RISK CALCULATION   (design/formula.md)
  driving path   web → victim.rs
  p              1.00   1 of 1 addresses forgeable
  P per attempt  1.000   = p × P(≥ 3 of 4 remote perspectives fooled)   [BR 3.2.2.9]
  likelihood L   1.000   = 1 − (1 − P)^5
  complexity K   1.000   = 0.87^0
  score          10.0   = Roundup(10 × 1 × K × L)   → Critical (CVSS scale)

